{
  "info": {
    "name": "BrainBuilder - Academic Session Module (New Session APIs + Modified Admission/Fee/Attendance)",
    "description": "Covers the new Academic Session feature: session lifecycle (create/activate), pre-admission into a future session, session-wise tagging on Student/Enrollment/Invoice/Attendance, the Promote Students workflow, and the Mark Left correction action.\n\nRequests are tagged in their names as **[NEW]** (endpoints added by this feature) or **[MODIFIED]** (existing endpoints that now also accept/return `sessionId`).\n\nHOW TO USE:\n1. Import this file into Postman (File > Import).\n2. Open the collection's Variables tab and fill in `base_url` (default http://localhost:5006/api), `admin_email` and `admin_password` for an existing admin account.\n3. Run folders 0 through 6 in order, top to bottom (Collection Runner, or click through manually) — later requests depend on IDs captured by earlier ones via test scripts.\n4. Folder 99 (Cleanup) cancels/closes out the ZZPM-tagged test records this run created. Run it last. Note: there is currently no DELETE endpoint for Academic Sessions or Invoices — the two ZZPM-tagged test sessions and the one test invoice this collection creates are left in place (clearly named, harmless) unless removed directly in the database.\n\nAll test data is tagged with the prefix `ZZPM` and a unique run_tag (timestamp) so repeat runs never collide.\n\nIMPORTANT — known pre-existing issue, unrelated to this feature: on some environments, writes to the `users` collection (i.e. new parent-account creation) can hang. If the \"Admit Student\" request in folder 2 never returns, that is this pre-existing issue, not an Academic Session bug — every other request in this collection avoids creating new Users.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "event": [
    {
      "listen": "prerequest",
      "script": {
        "type": "text/javascript",
        "exec": [
          "if (!pm.collectionVariables.get('run_tag')) {",
          "  pm.collectionVariables.set('run_tag', Date.now().toString());",
          "}"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5006/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_email",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_password",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "admin_token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "run_tag",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "parent_password",
      "value": "ZzPm@12345"
    },
    {
      "key": "class_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "session_a_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "session_b_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "student_id",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "student_id_next_year",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "enrollment_id",
      "value": ""
    },
